  "description_short": "Classic Karoo-style cooking in Great Brak River with hearty portions and friendly village atmosphere.",
  "description_long": "Transkaroo Restaurant brings authentic Karoo flavours to Great Brak River, serving up generous portions of traditional South African fare in a relaxed, welcoming setting. The menu celebrates local favourites with properly done steaks, lamb dishes, and home-style cooking that keeps regulars coming back.\n\nLocated on The Island in Great Brak River, this family-run spot has built a loyal following over the years with consistent quality and genuine hospitality. The atmosphere is unpretentious and comfortable, perfect for families and friends gathering over a good meal. It's the kind of place where you'll find locals tucking into their favourites alongside visitors discovering proper South African cooking.\n\nWith its solid reputation and mid-range pricing, Transkaroo offers honest value and flavours that remind you why traditional Karoo cooking has stood the test of time.",
